AB  - The aim of this article is to provide formulas and properties of the basic reproduction number, R-0 for a within-host virus model with periodic combination drug treatment. In particular, we extend and further results about how the phase difference between drug treatment can critically affect the asymptotic dynamics of model and corresponding R-0. Our main theorem establishes that R-0 is minimized for out-of-phase efficacies and maximized for in-phase efficacies in a special case where drug efficacies are "bang-bang" functions.
