TI  - Emerging disease dynamics in a model coupling within-host and between-host systems
T2  - JOURNAL OF THEORETICAL BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Within-host dynamics
KW  - Between-host dynamics
KW  - Coupled systems
KW  - Environmentally driven disease
