TI  - A novel intelligent framework for assessing within-host transmission dynamics of Chikungunya virus using an unsupervised stochastic neural network approach
T2  - COMPUTATIONAL BIOLOGY AND CHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - Chikungunya within-host model
KW  - Stochastic neural networks
