TI  - Hysteresis and Hopf bifurcation: Deciphering the dynamics of an in-host model of SARS-CoV-2 with logistic target cell growth and sigmoidal immune
T2  - CHAOS SOLITONS & FRACTALS
LA  - English
KW  - Within-host mathematical model
KW  - SARS-CoV-2
KW  - Saturated target cell growth
KW  - Sigmoidal immune cell growth
