TI  - ON MODELLING THE IN-HOST DYNAMICS OF HIV/HPV CO-INFECTION IN THE HUMAN POPULATION
T2  - COMMUNICATIONS IN MATHEMATICAL BIOLOGY AND NEUROSCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - human papillomavirus
KW  - immune response
KW  - cytotoxic T-Lymphocytes
KW  - vaccination
KW  - INFECTION
