TI  - No two without three: Modeling dynamics of the trio RNA virus-defective interfering genomes-satellite RNAs
T2  - COMMUNICATIONS IN NONLINEAR SCIENCE AND NUMERICAL SIMULATION
LA  - English
KW  - Bifurcations
KW  - Complex systems
KW  - Defective interfering genomes
KW  - Dynamical systems
