TI  - Modeling Dengue Immune Responses Mediated by Antibodies: Insights on the Biological Parameters to Describe Dengue Infections
T2  - COMPUTATIONAL AND MATHEMATICAL METHODS
LA  - English
KW  - DEPENDENT ENHANCEMENT
