TI  - Mapping of heterologous expressed sequence tags as an alternative to microarrays for study of defense responses in plants
T2  - BMC GENOMICS
LA  - English
KW  - CUCUMBER MOSAIC-VIRUS
KW  - ARABIDOPSIS-THALIANA
KW  - HYPERSENSITIVE RESPONSE
