TI  - Simultaneous inference of phylogenetic and transmission trees in infectious disease outbreaks
T2  - PLOS COMPUTATIONAL BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - MYCOBACTERIUM-TUBERCULOSIS
KW  - EVOLUTIONARY DYNAMICS
KW  - EPIDEMIOLOGIC DATA
